<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '60px', background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>02 · 架构与数据</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>云购生活 · 第 5 周综合答辩</Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 6 }}>四层数仓：每层都能独立对账</Text>

    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 10, marginBottom: 18 }} />

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, width: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '14px 16px', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>ODS 原始层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>6 表 · 114,809 行</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 2 }}>原样落地，脏数据保留</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', marginLeft: 10, marginRight: 10 }}>→</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '14px 16px', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>DWD 明细层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>20 表 · 14,398 单</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 2 }}>9 张维表 + 366 分区</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', marginLeft: 10, marginRight: 10 }}>→</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '14px 16px', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>DWS 汇总层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>7 表 · 五个切面</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 2 }}>日/周/月 + 品类/门店/渠道</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', marginLeft: 10, marginRight: 10 }}>→</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '14px 16px', background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>ADS 应用层</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#C9D8EF', marginTop: 4 }}>10 表 · 即取即用</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#9FB9E0', marginTop: 2 }}>字段名即展示名</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Table
            style={{ width: '100%', height: 250, marginTop: 22 }}
            defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', textAlign: 'left' }}
            defaultCellStyle={{
                border: {
                    left: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
                    right: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
                    top: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
                    bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
                },
                padding: { top: 8, bottom: 8, left: 12, right: 12 },
            }}
            cells={[
                [
                    { text: '层级', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
                    { text: '核心表', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
                    { text: '规模', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
                    { text: '设计要点', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
                ],
                ['ODS', 'ods_order / ods_order_item', '15,600 / 37,549 行', '不做清洗，保证可回溯到原始行'],
                [
                    { text: 'DWD', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                    { text: 'dwd_order / dwd_order_item_clean', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                    { text: '14,398 / 34,580 行', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                    { text: '星型建模；只有事实表按日分区', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                ],
                ['DWS', 'dws_trade_day / dws_category_day', '366 / 3,043 行', '保留时间粒度；金额不取整，保持可加'],
                [
                    { text: 'ADS', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                    { text: 'ads_kpi_core / ads_region_sales', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                    { text: '10 指标 / 15 行', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                    { text: '比率预算好，消费端零二次加工', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                ],
            ]}
        />

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 18, padding: '12px 18px', background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                关键取舍：汇总层<b>不在存储时取整</b>。分组取整再相加，3,043 个分组会累积出 0.13 元漂移——取整交给展示层，存储层保持可加。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 16, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>云购生活数据仓库项目组</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>07</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
